<<SetShot "CloseUp_B">>
Munir: You arrive quiet, but not tired.
<<SetShot "OTS_B">>

Prince: I don’t get tired like that.
Munir: Everyone does, eventually.
Prince: Then they rest.
Munir: Or they keep moving.
Prince: Moving keeps things simple.
Munir: Simple doesn’t mean light.
Prince: Never said it did.
